{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-11_end",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-11",
  "title": "战地救援",
  "storyCode": "9-13",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-11_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8c16447dfd8c37fbd53210d9b4ff16a391d28f000eb3e73c09aef04534f3e145",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "汉密尔顿上校，我希望你明白自己都做了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我做了什么？我成功打击了维多利亚的敌人，为我们赢来了难得的胜利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真以为你会赢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原本占领市政厅和其他重要设施的渣滓们都被清除了。你都听到了，我们的士兵正在一点点夺回城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使事情真的如你所愿，鬼魂部队就此一蹶不振，你顺利守住了小丘郡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也给维多利亚带来了不可逆的损失！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在说什么胡话？我知道了，你还在惦记着那些平民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我再说一遍，斯卡曼德罗斯，这是一场战争，没有什么胜利是不流血的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少冠冕堂皇了，你的目标从来都是当地居民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你命令炮兵营私藏军火，暗中制造脏弹的时候，鬼魂部队还没进入小丘郡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就是不肯善罢甘休是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，反正事情很顺利，你也没什么机会碍手碍脚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顺利？就因为你给眼前的战火煽了风？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "战争不是目的，而是手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们多年来拼命战斗，为的就是确保维多利亚的安全和稳固。而你呢？你只用了一个中午，就摧毁了无数人的努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你竟然以维多利亚军队的名义无差别地攻击平民——无论那些人是什么出身，他们在名义上都还是维多利亚公民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们把自己叫做塔拉人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们国家里有多少塔拉人？十分之一，还是五分之一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，你或许认为他们是少数。可这么多人的仇恨一旦被点燃，足以彻底毁掉我们的国家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，他们压根不是维多利亚军队的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们本来就不该成为我们的对手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看你在读的书，你尊崇着第一代阿斯兰王的伟业，但你有没有想过，是什么让来自异邦的阿斯兰成为了维多利亚的王？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果阿斯兰不是和德拉克签订了休战条约，如果当年的德拉克盖尔王没有退让并接受同族王室的决定，今天的维多利亚根本不会存在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有什么资格——只因为一己的仇恨和敌意，就将维多利亚再度拖至内战边缘？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯卡曼德罗斯，你当真相信你说的这些话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的以为，我区区一个地方驻军的指挥官，就能轻而易举地决定维多利亚未来的走向？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有没有想过，为什么......伦蒂尼姆没有声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本可以杀了你，纵使你是贵族，伦蒂尼姆也不会为了一名丧生在叛军炮火下的中尉而追究我的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是我没有。我尊重你对维多利亚的忠诚，我不忍看着所谓的人性钝化维多利亚的利剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "睁开眼睛看看吧，战争早就开始了！在最后一个敌人的鲜血流尽之前，我们都无法取得真正的胜利！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就没有想过，你所做的一切，正是我们的敌人想让你做的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你担心的事，恰好是我所希望的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我希望这些塔拉人的下场能传遍整个维多利亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要摧毁的不是这一群人，我要摧毁的是他们的勇气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要让所有人知道，在他们生出反叛之心的时候，都该掂量下自己能否承受住维多利亚的怒火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你今天点起来的这把火，要多少无辜者的鲜血才能浇灭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "心怀鬼胎的大公爵，暗中窥伺的各强邻，野心勃勃的异族人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——那么多图谋不轨的人聚在一起，伦蒂尼姆，乃至整个维多利亚，早就承受着超出阈值的压力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阴谋家们只等着小小的推力，然后，砰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火势一旦蔓延，不止会烧到塔拉人身上，到最后，在这片曾经繁华的土地上，无一人能够幸免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即便如此......也比沉默着被内部的蛀虫咬成空壳要好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来你不可能回头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，我和你，再无话可说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，我也不必再关着你，你想滚就滚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一旦释放我，我就不会放过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以三角铁小组的名义起誓——无论后面发生什么，只要我活着，我一定会把你抓上军事法庭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，你以为我会害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听着，斯卡曼德罗斯，如果维多利亚要审判我，我哪里都不会去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我迫不及待地想看到那一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大提琴，双簧管，我们去通讯基站。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "万一风笛没能把信使安全地送出城，那我们一定要把握住这唯一的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目前看来，通讯基站很可能已经落入敌手。这场仗一定不好打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，我们从来没有害怕过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前进吧，维多利亚的战士们！带上三角铁他们的份一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "战况怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么没有回复——希尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不在这里。你竟然，擅离职守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有我的命令，你去了哪里？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......伤员真的太多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "轻伤的尽量疏散，让他们去完好的建筑里避难，重症伤患集中送去最近的诊所——而且要记得做好隔离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "诊所的床铺很紧张。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "附近就是塔拉居民聚集的十七区，受到的轰炸最严重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有居民自发清理出了一块干净的区域，搭了几个帐篷和几十张床位，充当临时站点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您教我的防护方法，我也教了他们，几位志愿者正在把部分不算危重的伤员安置到帐篷里去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我把这里剩下的急救物资清理完，我就去找他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很擅长干这些事，他们很容易信任你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈......这些年在军营里，我所学的就是如何讨人喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们告诉我，仪仗兵是军队的脸面，我深信不疑，我习惯了他们用掌声和欢呼歌颂维多利亚的光辉和繁盛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没人能否认，这的确是维多利亚的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但并非全部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您同我说了那些话以后，我想到了一些被我遗忘的过去的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸爸是个律师，他就经常跟我讲爷爷的爷爷来维多利亚白手起家的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在他的描绘里，维多利亚是个发达、开明、生机勃勃的国家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这里，技术和资本战胜了蛮荒，人们努力积累的财富，不会轻易地被一场天灾或者部族争斗摧毁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正是因为来到了这样的国度，我们瓦伊凡才有机会不再靠着野蛮的武力生活下去，我们得以过上更“文明”的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在很长一段时间内，维多利亚无疑代表了大地上最先进的生产力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但为了变得更像一个维多利亚人，我们也放弃了很多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "五岁那年，当我为轻松爬上花园里最高的树而雀跃的时候，爸爸严厉地训斥了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他把我关在房间内，给我塞了几十本书，并在第二天就为我请了一位莱塔尼亚的钢琴教师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我那时虽然有些不舍得树上的风光，可并未多想，我相信爸爸是为了我好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他在帮助你更好地适应这里的规则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。书本，钢琴，花园......爸爸比我清楚，要是不适应的话，我们根本没法拥有这样的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，我还想到一件事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一次放学后，我看到我最喜欢的面包店后面，有几个高年级的学生正在欺负一个菲林女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们笑话她脏兮兮的衣裳，还笑话她什么都不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在他们走后，我悄悄地走上前，把我书包里的几本小说送给了那个女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以为等她看完了这些故事，她就能和同龄人聊起来，就不会再遭笑话了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一星期后我兴冲冲地去找她，想和她聊聊书里的内容，结果她摇了摇头，把书都还给了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一眼看出来，这些书她翻都没有翻开过。我当时很生气，觉得自己把心爱的书借给了她，想和她交朋友，而她居然一点都不领情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很久以后，我才知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她并不识字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作为面包店帮佣的孩子，她很难获得受教育的机会，更不必说和你一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来，能读小说也是一种奢侈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚从未能做到对所有人一视同仁，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "过去的我不愿意承认......是我主动适应了“规则”，我才成了一名合格的维多利亚人。而规则之外的人，从来不被维多利亚承认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能主动醒过来且保持清醒，这本身就需要勇气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤其这个梦是整个群体编织出来的关于某种文明形态的共同想象——相信我，没有人比我更了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为您是拉特兰人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我离开了拉特兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有机会的话真想听您讲讲过去的事......而不是让您听这么多傻兮兮的普通人的烦恼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "简，你并不普通。没有人该说自己普通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢，多亏了您一直安慰我，我才没有耽搁在没用的情绪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也从未停止努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "物资都收拾好了，我这就把它们搬去临时医疗点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路上依然要保持警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，现在城里乱成一片。好在驻军停止了攻击，暴徒也基本被打散了，只要市民们能团结起来，小丘郡还有救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人们远比想象中的要坚韧。许多野心家低估了这一点，最后输得很惨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，最大的问题还是，药品不太够用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先做好清洁和包扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我这里还有药，你们分给我的，我现在用不上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是能拿出来一部分，还能多救几个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "收回去。别打这个主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救人之前，先确保自己的安全。这是为了救更多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......好，我记住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我送完东西，我就回来找您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一片伤员处理得差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您还要去雕像另一侧吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士，我在望远镜里看到，在你前面不远的街区，还有一个受伤的人躺在地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女性，很年轻。看不出种族......大概是瓦伊凡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情况怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很不好。看样子，她的腹部被大块源石晶簇贯穿了，极大几率已经被感染，目前看来可能失血过多，正处于昏迷状态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我马上过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等......女士，我发现那是交战区！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽说目前附近没什么敌人，但那一带之前都被暴徒占领了，而且，背后那栋建筑就是他们的指挥中心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......伤者极有可能是对方的重要人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们这一路救人不分阵营。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我无法判断......奥利弗先生，你都听到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的......女士，我也不赞同贸然行动。这样一个牵扯众多的人物，要是真被我们救下了，搞不好会给罗德岛带来巨大的风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。你们看到的是一个权力斗争漩涡中心的人物染上了矿石病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我看到的是，一个感染者之后会因权力斗争而死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，在她真正死去之前，围绕着她还会有更多的权力斗争，更多人会随之丧命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这悲惨的命运降临之前，只要我有一丝机会阻止，我就不会放弃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......女士，我没法说服你，但我会服从你的指令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，奥利弗，我没有资格命令你，也不想命令你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请你记住，并且务必要在任务报告里写下来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是罗德岛精英干员的决策。这是我，Outcast，我个人的决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，也加上你的这些“可是”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“临时干员Outcast，未遵守地区负责人的撤退命令，一意孤行实施危险人物的救援”——就这么写。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算您这么说......女士，不考虑罗德岛，你继续前进也会很危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是为什么我们不能把更多人卷进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本次行动最好和罗德岛没关系。你和其他干员按原定计划行事，等完成救援任务，就立刻带着资料撤离小丘郡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员碎纸机",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......女士，我留下等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碎纸机？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员碎纸机",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奥利弗，你要是想的话，报告里加一句，把我就地开除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说什么混账话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好......好。你们去吧。不就是救一个感染者吗？这样的事，我们罗德岛从来干得不少！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员奥利弗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别想让我丢下你们任何一个，记得按时来会合点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢。奥利弗，你干得很出色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碎纸机，我也很感激你的帮助。但是，我希望你能听从我的建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就是——留在原地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前面我一个人去。无论发生什么，你们都不要管，到时候直接去会合地点就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员碎纸机",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是，女士。我会准备好接应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Outcast......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "简，你不会想要拉住我吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的要去救那个人吗？他们说，那人是暴徒里的重要人物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她会不会就是杀了西尔莎的凶手？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我想，一个神秘且有野心的组织，很难会放任自己真正的头领奄奄一息地躺在大街上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......那就好，我、我心里舒服多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果她是的话，你会怎么做？你会希望我不要救她吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说实话，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我认同您说的话，她是一名可怜的感染者，急需我们的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许等她脱离危险，我会问问她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，大概率是我想多了，我还是不耽误您的时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您跟我说过的，救人之前，先确保自己安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听听，我们的小简妮也学会反过来教育我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我不敢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像我们说好的——我只是去救一名普通的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
